xrf\"/></pre></div><div><div class=\" response-message\"><p>Writing poll report to <a href='fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.md' target='_blank'>fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.md</a> <a href='fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.html' target='_blank'>html</a></p>\n</div></div><div><div class=\" completion-message response-message\"><p>Completed poll simulation with 3 responses in 121s</p>\n</div></div><div><div class=\" completion-message response-message\"><div class=\"tabs-container\" id=\"d9210b88-d734-4371-be60-356eb3aacb66\">\n<div class=\"tabs\">\n<button class=\"tab-button active\" data-for-tab=\"HTML\">HTML</button>\n<button class=\"tab-button\" data-for-tab=\"Markdown\">Markdown</button>\n<button class=\"tab-button\" data-for-tab=\"Hide\">Hide</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content active\" data-tab=\"HTML\">\n<h2>Summary</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Total Respondents:</strong> 6</li>\n<li><strong>Successful Responses:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Response Rate:</strong> 50.0%</li>\n<li><strong>Total Time:</strong> 121.689s</li>\n<li><strong>Avg Response Time:</strong> 63.111333333333334s</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Findings</h2>\n<h3>Response Summary</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Total Responses:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Avg Response Time:</strong> 63111ms</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>q1: How likely are you to recommend our AI services to a colleague?</h3>\n<p><strong>Statistics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mean: 3.00</li>\n<li>Median: 3.00</li>\n<li>Std Dev: 0.82</li>\n<li>Min: 2.0</li>\n<li>Max: 4.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>q2: Which feature do you find most valuable?</h3>\n<p><strong>Response Distribution:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accuracy: 3 (100.0%)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>q3: What is the primary reason for your rating in the first question?</h3>\n<p><strong>Text Analysis:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Responses: 3</li>\n<li>Avg Length: 849 characters</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sample Responses:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;I gave that rating because, while I recognize that AI can be a helpful tool for organizing initial research or brainstorming, I have a lot of reservat...&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;The primary reason for my rating is my deep-seated concern over how automation is eroding genuine critical thinking and the &quot;human&quot; element of creativ...&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;I gave my rating because, as a humanities student, I have a very complicated relationship with AI. On one hand, I’m genuinely enthusiastic about how i...&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Insights</h2>\n<p>This analysis is based on a small-scale pilot survey ($N=3$) targeting a specific demographic: female humanities students aged 18–24.</p>\n<h3>1. Key Findings and Trends</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The &quot;Cautious Middle&quot; Sentiment:</strong> The mean score for recommendation (Q1) is exactly <strong>3.00</strong>, with a spread from 2 to 4. This indicates a lack of &quot;promoters&quot; (scores of 9–10 in NPS terms) and a high concentration of &quot;passives&quot; or &quot;detractors.&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Accuracy as a Baseline:</strong> 100% of respondents selected &quot;Accuracy&quot; as the most valuable feature. This suggests that for this cohort, accuracy is a &quot;hygiene factor&quot;—a requirement for entry—rather than a competitive advantage that drives high recommendation scores.</li>\n<li><strong>The &quot;Research Assistant&quot; Paradox:</strong> Qualitative data reveals a consistent trend: respondents value AI for <strong>organizational tasks</strong> (brainstorming, research assistance) but deeply distrust it for <strong>analytical or creative tasks</strong>. They view AI as a tool for the &quot;process&quot; but a threat to the &quot;product.&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. Demographic Patterns and Differences</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Extreme Homogeneity:</strong> All three respondents share identical demographic profiles (18–24, Female, Suburban, Some College). This eliminates demographic variance, making this less of a &quot;survey&quot; and more of a <strong>persona deep-dive</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Psychographic Alignment:</strong> Despite the small sample, there is a strong shared identity as &quot;Humanities Students.&quot; All three responses mention &quot;academic integrity,&quot; &quot;critical thinking,&quot; and the &quot;human soul/element.&quot; This suggests that for this specific group, the resistance to AI is philosophical and tied to their professional identity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. Response Consistency and Quality</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>High Engagement:</strong> The average response length is <strong>849 characters</strong>, which is exceptionally high for a digital poll. This indicates that the topic is highly polarizing or personally significant to the respondents.</li>\n<li><strong>Internal Validity:</strong> There is high consistency between the numerical ratings in Q1 and the sentiment in Q3.\n*</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>Full poll report: <a href='fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.md' target='_blank'>fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.md</a> <a href='fileIndex/G-20260115-KS2W/poll_simulation_report_20260115134716.html' target='_blank'>html</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\" data-tab=\"Markdown\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-markdown\">## Summary\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Total Respondents:</strong> 6</li>\n<li><strong>Successful Responses:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Response Rate:</strong> 50.0%</li>\n<li><strong>Total Time:</strong> 121.689s</li>\n<li><strong>Avg Response Time:</strong> 63.111333333333334s</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Findings</h2>\n<h3>Response Summary</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Total Responses:</strong> 3</li>\n<li><strong>Avg Response Time:</strong> 63111ms</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>q1: How likely are you to recommend our AI services to a colleague?</h3>\n<p><strong>Statistics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mean: 3.00</li>\n<li>Median: 3.00</li>\n<li>Std Dev: 0.82</li>\